; gr2_cfw shutdown hook (copy to H:/Shutdown.ttl). Runs on every normal power-off.
; `cfw status`: debug builds log the session state (task heartbeat, settings,
; last key messages) to H:/cfw/cfw_log.txt; release builds log nothing.
; ASCII, CRLF, uppercase drive letters.

sprintf "cfw status"
sendln inputstr
pause 1
end
